  "description": "A chat that answers from your MgSoftDev.KnowledgeHub documentation, inside your own Blazor app, with the signed-in user's permissions. Works with any IChatClient (Claude through the Anthropic SDK, or another provider). The model's Markdown is rendered as components, never as raw HTML. A host with its own chat can skip the component and add the KnowledgeHub tools to its own. Works in Blazor Server, WPF BlazorWebView and WebAssembly (through a server-side chat endpoint).",
